ep Convolutional Networks for Large-Scale Image Recognition\",\n            \"author\": \"Simonyan et al.\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"title\": \"Learning Multiple Tasks with Multilingual Multi-Task Networks\",\n            \"author\": \"Luong et al.\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"title\": \"Object Detection via a Fully Convolutional Network\",\n            \"author\": \"Redmon et al.\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"title\": \"Faster R-CNN: Towards Real-Time Object Detection with Region Proposal Networks\",\n            \"author\": \"Ren et al.\"\n        }\n    ]\n}"}
